# Datacluster

Cost-optimized Apache Spark platform on Hetzner Cloud with Talos Kubernetes (€10/month).

**Features:**
- 2-node Kubernetes cluster (Talos OS)
- Terraform infrastructure as code
- SOPS-encrypted secrets
- Tailscale VPN for secure access
- Spark Operator for batch/streaming jobs
- GitOps with FluxCD

---

## Quick Start

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<you>/datacluster.git
cd datacluster

# 1. Configure secrets
cp age.key.example age.key  # Add your SOPS key
cd terraform-v2
cp terraform.tfvars.example terraform.tfvars.enc
# Edit and encrypt with: sops --encrypt --in-place terraform.tfvars.enc

# 2. Deploy infrastructure
terraform init
terraform apply

# 3. Access cluster via Tailscale VPN
export KUBECONFIG=$PWD/kubeconfig
kubectl get nodes
```

See `terraform-v2/README.md` for detailed setup.

---

## Repository Structure

```
terraform-v2/       # Active Terraform config (Hetzner infrastructure)
talos/              # Talos cluster definition (SOPS-encrypted)
clusters/           # Flux GitOps configs
infrastructure/     # Platform components (Spark, monitoring, storage)
pipelines/          # Spark job definitions
src/                # PySpark application code
docs/               # Architecture and guides
```

---

## Prerequisites

- Hetzner Cloud account + API token
- Tailscale account for VPN access
- Tools: `terraform`, `kubectl`, `sops`, `age`, `hcloud` CLI

---

## Cost

| Component | Monthly |
|-----------|---------|
| CX23 control-plane | €3.75 |
| CX33 worker | €6.26 |
| Public IPv4 (×2) | €1.26 |
| **Total** | **€10.01** |

